        "source_id": "airmf",
        "check_status": "rejected",
        "quote": "It describes four specific functions to help organizations address the risks of AI systems in practice. These functions – GOVERN , MAP, MEASURE , and MANAGE – are broken down further into categories and subcate-gories.",
