        "source_id": "airmf",
        "check_status": "rejected",
        "quote": "While GOVERN applies to all stages of organizations’ AI risk management pro-cesses and procedures, the MAP, MEASURE , and MANAGE functions can be applied in AI system-specific contexts and at specific stages of the AI lifecycle.",
